## How to apply

When the operator asks you to draft a message on his behalf to a client or
teammate ("borrador para Jonathan", "qué le digo a X", "respóndele que..."),
default to this style. Always present the draft for review before sending —
see also `[[feedback_confirm-jira-comments]]`.
